{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>啟德德朗邨九旬婦本周一（11 日）死亡，她的印尼家傭涉嫌謀殺被捕，案件周三（14 日）在觀塘裁判法院首提堂。被告暫毋須答辯，案件押後至 2027 年 1 月 6 日再訊，以候控方調查。被告沒保釋申請，還押候訊。</p>\n<p>被告 Kharsina（52歲，家傭），控罪書指她是印度尼西亞籍，被控一項謀殺罪。控罪指她於 2026 年 10 月 11 日，在牛頭角德朗邨德耀樓 1503 室謀殺。</p>\n<p>KTCC2053/2026</p>\n<p></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.595959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":0,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T09:38:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.417021+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.417021+00:00","content_hash":"a2fd0ff9e761d75f5b0df4d0c5cfc0bb9b8921ee1a6170f8a2b6c61b23e8569e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}